<div class="mm-panel mm-panel-attention">
  <h2 class="mm-panel-header">
    PB3K-OS v2.1p207 // NEW PROSPECTOR ORIENTATION
  </h2>
  <div class="mm-panel-body">

    <p class="mm-text-amber" style="margin-top:0">WELCOME, Prospector!</p>
    <p>International Prospecting Machines (IPM) is proud to present the latest model
      in our most trusted product line, the ProspectBoy 3000 (PB3K).  This unit 
      brings the latest advances in prospecting analytics and extraction management 
      technologies available on the consumer market today.  It is your primary interface 
      for artifact recovery, assessment, enhancement, and, sale.</p>

    <p class="mm-section-label">Getting Started</p>

    <p>Use your PB3K to locate and extract the most valuable artifacts from the anomalous 
      and productive Magic Mountain.  The PB3K can help you modify these artifacts to 
      achieve the highest price for your local market conditions.  
      The highest performing prospector across a sales season will be rewarded!</p>

    <p class="mm-section-label">OPERATIONAL CYCLE</p>
    <p>
      Note: each of the following PB3K features may use a portion of daily energy called 
      <em>Action Points</em> (AP).  The unit needs to be inactive for the AP to recharge.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>PROSPECT</strong> (cost: 2 AP)<br>
        Scans the mountain to locate salable artifacts.
        Once an artifact is extracted, its value can be increased using the 
        <strong>PUSH</strong> function.  Careful!  Artifacts in poor condition may 
        break with excessive modifications.
      </li>
      <li><strong>BAZAAR</strong> (cost: 1 AP)<br>
        The Bazaar is a virtual, online marketplace that allows you to connect with 
        buyers of different factions.  Selling to factions increases the faction's influence
        on the local market.  Caveat venditor! 
      </li>
      <li><strong>PAWN</strong> (cost: 1 AP)<br>
        Due to local market conditions, some items may not be legal to sell.  IPM recommends 
        holding on to these items until local prohibitions change.  In the interests of full 
        disclosure, there are unsanctioned third-party apps that will connect you to illegal 
        vendors who will pay above market prices for your goods.  However, should your sale 
        be discovered by the authorities, you will lose your artifact all together.
      </li>
      <li><strong>INTEL</strong> (cost: 0 AP)<br>
        When local competition increases, you may wish to disadvantage your rivals with various 
        promotional activities.  These activities cost you scrap and, perhaps, the respect of 
        your peers. 
      </li>
      <li><strong>CERTS</strong> (cost: 0 AP)<br>
        IPM is proud to offer these online courses to improve every aspect of your prospecting 
        career.  Such lessons are available on an a la carte basis. 
      </li>
      
    </ol>

    <p class="mm-section-label">THE SALES SEASON</p>
    <p>
      For tax purposes, each sales period is grouped into a season that runs for 30 days. 
      Total sales determine final sales rank at the end of the season. 
      A new season begins automatically because money never sleeps.</p>

    <p class="mm-text-dim" style="font-size:0.68rem">This orientation will not repeat. 
      Access it again via [?] in the status header.</p>

    <button class="mm-btn mm-btn-primary mm-btn-block" style="margin-top:0.5rem"
      data-action-url="<%= $dismiss_url %>" data-method="POST"
      data-redirect="<%= url_for('game') %>">OK</button>

  </div>
</div>